      "Text": "Security update for python3-pyOpenSSL",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for python3-pyOpenSSL fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-27448: unhandled exception in `set_tlsext_servername_callback` callback can result in connection not being\n  cancelled and allows for possible security measure bypassing (bsc#1259804).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
